CR Bevel uses two licenses.

1. CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication): everything in this repository
   except the add-on code listed below. That includes the CR Bevel node groups
   (library/cr_bevel_library.blend), the script that builds them (src/), the
   tests and the documentation. Anyone may copy, modify, sell or redistribute
   them, for any purpose, without asking or giving credit.
   Full text: LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt

2. GNU General Public License v3.0 or later: the Blender add-on code in
   extension/__init__.py, and the extension package built from it (the zip
   attached to each release). Blender's Extensions platform requires this
   license for add-ons. The node group library bundled inside that package
   stays CC0.
   Full text: LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later.txt

Each source file names its license in an SPDX-License-Identifier line.
Models, renders and other work made with CR Bevel belong to their authors and
are not covered by either license.
